  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "scroll-cue-1",
      "transcript": "This burned scroll was too fragile to open. Scientists read it anyway.",
      "file": "audio/scroll/narration/cue-1.wav",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 4.975,
      "beatIndex": 0,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "sealed-scroll.asset.read-without-opening.script.1",
      "samples": 119400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "scroll-cue-2",
      "transcript": "The En-Gedi scroll crumbled when it was touched.",
      "file": "audio/scroll/narration/cue-2.wav",
      "start": 5.366666666666666,
      "duration": 3.025,
      "beatIndex": 1,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "sealed-scroll.asset.read-without-opening.script.2",
      "samples": 72600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "scroll-cue-3",
      "transcript": "Researchers scanned it with X-rays, building a three-dimensional map.",
      "file": "audio/scroll/narration/cue-3.wav",
      "start": 8.6,
      "duration": 4.5,
      "beatIndex": 2,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "sealed-scroll.asset.read-without-opening.script.3",
      "samples": 108000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "scroll-cue-4",
      "transcript": "Inside that scan, they traced the surviving layers.",
      "file": "audio/scroll/narration/cue-4.wav",
      "start": 13.3,
      "duration": 3.65,
      "beatIndex": 3,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "sealed-scroll.asset.read-without-opening.script.4",
      "samples": 87600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "scroll-cue-5",
      "transcript": "In this scroll, the ink showed up more densely than the parchment.",
      "file": "audio/scroll/narration/cue-5.wav",
      "start": 17.166666666666668,
      "duration": 4.15,
      "beatIndex": 4,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "sealed-scroll.asset.read-without-opening.script.5",
      "samples": 99600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "scroll-cue-6",
      "transcript": "They mapped that signal onto digital surfaces, then flattened them into readable images.",
      "file": "audio/scroll/narration/cue-6.wav",
      "start": 21.533333333333335,
      "duration": 5.775,
      "beatIndex": 5,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "sealed-scroll.asset.read-without-opening.script.6",
      "samples": 138600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "scroll-cue-7",
      "transcript": "The recovered Hebrew text came from the Book of Leviticus.",
      "file": "audio/scroll/narration/cue-7.wav",
      "start": 27.7,
      "duration": 3.85,
      "beatIndex": 6,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "sealed-scroll.asset.read-without-opening.script.7",
      "samples": 92400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "scroll-cue-8",
      "transcript": "This worked because the ink was detectable in the scan. Different materials need different approaches.",
      "file": "audio/scroll/narration/cue-8.wav",
      "start": 31.766666666666666,
      "duration": 6.625,
      "beatIndex": 7,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "sealed-scroll.asset.read-without-opening.script.8",
      "samples": 159000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "scroll-cue-9",
      "transcript": "They revealed surviving writing without unrolling the fragile original.",
      "file": "audio/scroll/narration/cue-9.wav",
      "start": 38.6,
      "duration": 4.95,
      "beatIndex": 8,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "sealed-scroll.asset.read-without-opening.script.9",
      "samples": 118800,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    }
